/**
 * @page changelog Changelog
 * @brief History of changes, fixes and new features across all versions
 *
 * @section v0_5_2 v0.5.2 - (06-10-2026)
 *
 * @subsection v0_5_2_changed Changed
 * - Reworked the event system around subscriptions: a Layer (or the Application) calls
 *   EventListener::subscribe<T>(handler) once, e.g. from its constructor, instead of overriding OnEvent.
 *   A handler returning true consumes the event
 * - Events are queued and sent once per frame, before Layer::OnUpdate, instead of from inside the GLFW callbacks
 * - Events carry their data as public members (KeyPressedEvent::key, WindowResizeEvent::width...) and
 *   KeyPressedEvent::repeat is a bool
 * - EventCategory is an enum class (EventCategory::Keyboard instead of EventCategoryKeyboard)
 * @subsection v0_5_2_added Added
 * - EventBase, to define an application's own events, and Application::postEvent to send them
 * - KeyTypedEvent, WindowFocusEvent, WindowMovedEvent, WindowMinimizeEvent and FilesDroppedEvent
 * - Event::is<T> and Event::as<T>, for the handlers subscribed to every event (subscribe<Event>)
 * - KeyMods: the modifier keys held, in KeyPressedEvent/KeyReleasedEvent (with the scancode) and in the mouse
 *   button events
 * - MouseMovedEvent::dx and MouseMovedEvent::dy, the movement since the previous MouseMovedEvent
 * - FramebufferResizeEvent (size in pixels), WindowContentScaleEvent and MouseEnterEvent
 * - ScopedSubscription and EventListener::subscribeScoped: a subscription removed when its handle is destroyed
 * - Application::sendEvent, to send an event right away and know whether a listener consumed it
 * - Application::postEvent can be called from any thread; the event is still sent on the main thread
 * - Application::observeEvents: a function called after every event, consumed or not, with who consumed it
 * @subsection v0_5_2_editor_added Editor Addition
 * - Window > Event Log: the last events sent, filtered by category or text, and who consumed each
 * - Files and folders dropped onto the editor are copied into the content browser's current folder
 * - The editor's own events: AssetMovedEvent (replaces ContentBrowserPanel::setOnMoved), SceneOpenedEvent and
 *   SelectionChangedEvent
 * @subsection v0_5_2_removed Removed
 * - Layer::OnEvent, EventDispatcher, EventType, Event::Handled, the EVENT_CLASS_* and VC_BIND_EVENT_FN* macros
 * - The KeyEvent and MouseButtonEvent intermediate classes, and the unused AppTick/AppUpdate/AppRender types
 *
 * ---
 *
 * @section v0_5_0 v0.5.0 — (24-05-2026)
 *
 * @subsection v0_5_0_added Added
 * - New Scene and Entity class
 * - 4 Component struct
 * - New PerspectiveCamera::getCurrentCamera and PerspectiveCamera.setAsCurrent function
 * - Started using EnTT
 * @subsection v0_5_0_changed Changed
 * - Renamed PerspectiveCamera to Camera
 * - DynamicSSBO now takes a shared_ptr
 * - Texture.useTexture now return the texture index and have only the name parameter
 * @subsection v0_5_0_fixed Fixed
 * - Fix ImGui ID bug
 * - Fix ImGui Import
 * @subsection v0_5_0_removed Removed
 * - Application::resetCache & Application::flush
 * - All the functions in Camera that give information about the 3D state of it
 * - MeshManager, Model and Transform class
 *
 * ---
 *
 * @section v0_4_2 v0.4.2 — (20-04-2026)
 *
 * @subsection v0_4_2_editor_added Editor Addition
 * - Creation of the editor
 * @subsection v0_4_2_added Added
 * - New Framebuffer class
 * - New Layer.OnRenderOffscreen() function for drawing on framebuffer
 * @subsection v0_4_2_changed Changed
 * - Started using Vulkan dynamic rendering
 * - Started using Volk for Vulkan graphic API
 * - Updated VmaAllocator to support Vulkan 1.3
 * @subsection v0_4_2_fixed Fixed
 * - Fix ImGui ID bug
 * - Fix ImGui Import
 *
 * ---
 *
 * @note Only the minor updates are written before this version
 *
 * ---
 *
